    "q-41203": {
      "dom_id": "step-q41203",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "If $p=2$ and $q=-2,$ then $8p+7q+2=$",
      "worked_solution": "Replacing $p$ with $2$ and $q$ with $-2$ in the expression, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8p+7q+2 & = \\\\ 8(2)+7(-2)+2 & = \\\\ 16+(-14)+2 & = \\\\ 16-14+2 & = \\\\ 4.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
